            "line": 295,
            "text": "theorem pressureFromSource_eq_primitive {S : Set ℝ} (hS : IsOpen S)\n    (source : EvenProfile S) (w : ℝ × ℝ) :\n    pressureFromSource hS source w =\n      ProfileHistories.primitive (fun p => p.1 * source p) w"
